  "releaseNotes": "GroupAsync(collectionName, queryOptions) answers a grouped read correctly:\n  -the total is the number of groups the page is cut from, not the number of documents behind them\n  -the groups are ordered before they are paged, so a page no longer repeats or hides one\n  -the page and the total are read in a single pass\n  An ungrouped read is unchanged, and so is FindPagesAsync.",
